<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>{{> head}}</head>
<body>
{{> nav}}

{{> page-hero image=post.image crumb=post.title eyebrow=post.date heading=post.title subtitle=post.excerpt}}

<section>
  <div class="container" style="max-width:820px">
    <p>{{post.excerpt}} Interior design is never one-size-fits-all — it is a balance of function, mood and the small personal details that make a space feel lived-in rather than staged.</p>
    <p>At Forever Dream Spaces, every project starts with listening: how do you use this room, at what time of day, with whom? Those answers shape everything from the floor plan to the final cushion.</p>
    <h3>Key Takeaways</h3>
    <ul class="check-list">
      <li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Start with function before aesthetics</li>
      <li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Let natural light guide your colour palette</li>
      <li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Invest in a few statement pieces rather than many small ones</li>
      <li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Layer lighting for morning, evening and entertaining</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Want to bring these ideas into your own home or office? Our design team would love to help.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Get Free Consultation <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="background:var(--paper-alt)">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head center reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="justify-content:center">Keep Reading</p>
      <h2>More from the Blog</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-3" style="max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)">
      {{#each related}}
      <a href="/blog/{{slug}}" class="blog-card reveal">
        <img src="{{image}}" alt="{{title}}" loading="lazy">
        <div class="body">
          <div class="meta">{{date}}</div>
          <h3>{{title}}</h3>
          <span class="read-more">Read Article <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
        </div>
      </a>
      {{/each}}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{{> footer}}
<script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
